      "message": "I think we have a problem here. This function does two things(it used to be called on guest VMEXIT):\n1. Save guest PKRU and restore host PKRU\n2. Restore host XCR0 and IA32_XSS\n\nWhen we call it here before VMENTRY and hence hardware has host PKRU. So saving guest PKRU is actually copying host PKRU to guest snapshot:\n```\nvcpu-\u003earch.pkru \u003d rdpkru();\n```\n\nI think we overwrite the guest PKRU and actual guest PKRU is lost.\n\n@chuanxiao.dong@intel.corp-partner.google.com\u0027s proposal would make this point irrelevant though",
